    "details": "<p><strong>Key Dates:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Registration &amp; Idea Submission Deadline: 6th October 2026</li>\n<li>Shortlisted teams will be announced shortly after, and must complete Round 2 registration fee payment to confirm their spot in the Grand Finale.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility &amp; Team Guidelines:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to all college students.</li>\n<li>Each team must have 2&ndash;4 members. No individual can be part of more than one team.</li>\n<li>Register online through Unstop with the following details for each member:\n<ul>\n<li>Full Name</li>\n<li>College Name</li>\n<li>Contact Information</li>\n<li>Student ID</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Submission Guidelines:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Submit your idea using our official PPT template.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What Happens Next:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Registered teams must submit their idea (PPT) before the deadline above.</li>\n<li>Shortlisted teams advance to the Grand Finale (Round 2), an on-campus build round, after paying the registration fee of <strong>₹1000</strong>.</li>\n<li>Successful registrants will be notified via Unstop with further instructions.</li>\n</ul>",
